{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c52450c46309346075970e448b33ea806c2df6f8860e4fcd89cd8ddee04f7f52",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7461023787749c2397513b2509caaece53b2ec7eb45f29bd06ade085b0549b14",
      "text": "喂，北斗。\n你生日那天有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7d6cf85ec9ee9a2a1cd2c19af7624f08ecdc9ccee70255765f9a85da339a742",
      "text": "我正和冬马君商量说\n想给北斗君办生日派对呢～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a7f2d52edface7b50fe6201da553366474fba96fa84e3246fd9231f10afac7",
      "text": "嘛，虽然你可能已经有安排了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba22e4efce8409ba5dca2e9ff480795265b8c3e7821fda7a508f89121316f0f6",
      "text": "当然OK啦，一整天都有空。\n只要没有突发的工作就行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5543630d72be1cacc422a9a5ddb1681d4fcb2633c1de022d729416852c41960f",
      "text": "呵呵。我猜你们两个一定会帮我庆祝，\n所以就没排其他行程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:906aedda273daff6186febb868c28c36a78d1882e42d8dbf8cf220eadefc6107",
      "text": "是、这样啊……嘿嘿。\n很懂嘛，北斗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1025bfebe33860dbaa38eba12a23223ee0cd80972b6945c7e3eecbb76c328f1e",
      "text": "太好啦～♪\n这样就有大餐吃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3445826bfaa521f617eecfced842dc92f35e4ab56e0842ea4027b75f76fde679",
      "text": "虽然是我主动约的，但原本还以为\n当天你的行程肯定按分钟排满了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb320ae7c1ac141363629e872148811ba7799ae2c620eebf1981875c8f10a49",
      "text": "既然要办，就要让你觉得选我们而不是女孩子是正确的。\n对吧，冬马君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60378559a1b4de57b40e491784eea82e0f99776233d959e7091b833597044e50",
      "text": "嗯，生日就在我家办派对吧。\n好好期待着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b016f4b33ccac40aa8e7ac473eab5c6cf8bc9ffac018dbdfdd068859cdc5f1",
      "text": "……关于那件事，\n难得有这机会，我想拜托你们一件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
